<div class="graphics-article-title" >
  Sound of Sunshine Mix
  <div style="font-size: 12px; line-height: 14px; max-width: 223px; margin: 6px auto; padding-top: 6px; border-top: 1px solid #000;">
  A mix inspired by the heyday of radio by Jeremy Anderegg.
  </div>
</div>
<div>
  <img id="main-image" src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0664/2387/files/aaaaPW_Jeremy_Adsum-6.jpg?v=1599139662" alt="Sound of Sunshine Mix - Adsum">
</div>
<div class="centered-article-text">
  <p>
    What exactly is the sound of sunshine? We reached out to friend of the brand and frequent Lot Radio contributor, Jeremy Anderegg, to see what he thought. What does he imagine when he thinks of the heyday of radio and the sounds you’d want to hear coming out of a car on a hot summer’s day.
His answer, in the form of a new mix, nailed it for us. Bring a little light into your day and listen to it below.
  </p>
</div>

